A vintage 1950s style illustration of colorful exotic birds gathered in a circle on tree branches, appearing to be in animated discussion, with some birds leaning in attentively while others gesture with their wings. The scene is set against a warm sunset sky with soft orange and gold tones. Filing cabinets and folder icons are subtly integrated into the tree trunk bark pattern, suggesting document storage. The birds have distinct personalities shown through their postures - some eager, some contemplative. Rendered in mid-century advertising art style with slightly muted colors, gentle gradients, and the characteristic optimistic warmth of vintage travel posters.
